type: software
title: "Magnolia: Plant detection and quantification"
authors:
  - family-names: Manjunatha
    given-names: Harshita
abstract: >-
  A browser-based research prototype for detecting and quantifying plants in
  overhead nursery imagery using a fine-tuned YOLO11n model, ONNX inference,
  inspectable bounding boxes, and downloadable results.
